"""Platform Health Service — Phase 15.

Orchestrates health assessment of canonical entities from Phase 14
discovery results.

    DiscoveryResult (Phase 14)
        ↓
    HealthService.assess()
        ↓
    HealthExtractor (provider-specific)
        ↓
    HealthReport

This service is READ_ONLY — no mutation operations.
Provider-specific health extraction is delegated to HealthExtractor
implementations, following the same pattern as ProviderNormalizer.

New providers add a new HealthExtractor — the core HealthService
does not need modification.
"""
